From b6e5acbf02e34dc1cbba56fe5758af79153b5626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ravindu Lakshan Weerasinghe <ravinduarduino1000@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 2026 18:50:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: admin dashboard UI fixes + settings page deep
 integration

- Hide public navbar/footer on admin pages via CSS :has() selector
- Enlarge Revenue Trend chart (300px -> 420px), fix grid layout
- Fix notification icon clipping (explicit 44px sizing, overflow visible)
- Create SiteSettings helper (core/SiteSettings.php) for global DB settings access
- Fix getCategoryFromKey() - explicit key-to-category mapping for all 41 settings
- Wire SiteSettings into main layout (site_name, site_description)
- Wire SiteSettings into footer (contact_email, support_phone)
- Wire SiteSettings into EmailService (SMTP host/port/credentials from DB)
- Add maintenance mode check in index.php (blocks public with 503)
- Add timezone override from admin settings
- Flush settings cache after bulk save
- Seed all missing settings keys in database
- Fix AdminContactController SQL ambiguity
- Fix AdminPaymentController protected method access
- Fix admin-settings.js tab switching with data-tab attributes
